{"reviews":[{"id":"B0761GY67F-0","r":5.0,"t":"Overall I\u2019m satisfied.","x":"More like a 4.5. I was aware that it would be on nylon, but it\u2019s like someone literally cut up pantyhose and used it as a head band. Very stretchy, though. However, the color of the nylon may not work for everything like white or black would. The leather bows are well made, durable, and cute as can be.","h":5,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-1","r":2.0,"t":"Pink one came messed up","x":"Seem okay. But one came that\u2019s unusable. The one I wanted for a costume :( Lame. Nylon isn\u2019t the strongest material. But the product should be as advertised when I open the package.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-2","r":5.0,"t":"Worth it!","x":"Cute every day bows that are so worth the price! The nylon strap is stretchy and gentle on my 6 week old daughters little noggin. I\u2019m so glad i found these! She gets many compliments for her cute bows \ud83e\udd17","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-3","r":5.0,"t":"I love these! They're adorable and fit my 2 month ...","x":"I love these! They're adorable and fit my 2 month old perfectly. They aren't super tight or loose and the nylon doesn't leave any imprints on her forehead.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-4","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Good quality bows. Nylon hairband has great stretch. Great value!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-5","r":5.0,"t":"Just as pictured","x":"These bows are super cute and the fabric for the headband is soo stretchy and soft. I\u2019d say it perfect for my 6month old. She\u2019s starting to pull off the bows and the elastic would hurt her but with these bows I\u2019m not concerned if she pulls on them. I don\u2019t love that the I side of the fabric is white but it\u2019s not a big deal. The price is great and I\u2019d buy more.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-6","r":5.0,"t":"and the perfect size for a baby under 1","x":"Very cute faux-leather bows! Soft, and the perfect size for a baby under 1. I think my almost 3 yr old can probably wear these, too. A color for every outfit! The nylon bands are stretchy and don\u2019t leave marks. Since I saw that some reviews mentioned a fishy smell, I do want to state that the bows I received have no odor whatsoever.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-7","r":4.0,"t":"Almost perfect","x":"Super cute and the leather looks like quality material but the band causes a dent in little ones head even those they are pretty soft and stretchy. :(  stopped using them even tho she didn\u2019t seemed bothered by them bc of the dents.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-8","r":5.0,"t":"Love the headbands","x":"Love the headbands. They stretch so they are not too tight or too loose on my child\u2019s head. Comfortable for my daughter and so many colors to choose from. I would absolutely purchase again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-9","r":1.0,"t":"Bows come unglued easily - poor quality.","x":"I am so disappointed in the quality of the bows. They are coming apart by the second wear. My daughter is six months old. She isn\u2019t even pulling on them and the bows are coming unglued.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-10","r":2.0,"t":"Love the nylon bands","x":"Love the nylon bands, they are soft, stretch and don't leave marks on the head. The bad part about theses headbands is that the bows fells off. I had to reglue almost every single one","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-11","r":2.0,"t":"Smell horrible","x":"These bows are cute but omgggggg the smell is horrendous!! I can\u2019t get the smell to go away..I even tried febreeze and air them out and they made my babies head stink \ud83d\ude12.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-12","r":5.0,"t":"Tremendous value and so cute!","x":"These are such a great value; I definitely recommend picking them up! They do have an odd factory type smell to them, but after I hand washed them, they are perfect!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-13","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality and value!","x":"Perfect baby bows! Love the color range. Such a great value for this set! Hopefully my little girl will keep them on her head when she arrives in a couple weeks! :)","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-14","r":5.0,"t":"Happy Customer!","x":"These are so cute! They are of good quality, nice color selection and the nylon band is stretchy enough to be comfortable on my (very big) 8 month old\u2019s head.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-15","r":5.0,"t":"SUPER COMFORTABLE AND SOFT","x":"Absolutely love these bows! They do not squeeze the head or leave marks and are very giving for any size head! Definitely recommend for any mama of a girl!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-16","r":1.0,"t":"Can see white inside of bow","x":"Many of the bows are not perfectly aligned and as a result you can easily see the white interior of the bow when it is being worn.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-17","r":5.0,"t":"Super cute for my 3 month old","x":"Super cute for my 3 month old! Love the color variation. And they don\u2019t feel super tight on her scalp like most headbands do","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-18","r":5.0,"t":"Cute and Affordable!","x":"These are super cute and a great price for so many!  I now feel like I have a headband to go with every outfit.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-19","r":4.0,"t":"Super cute Bows","x":"These bows are super cute on my daughter. Can\u2019t beat the price and you get every color to go with whatever outfit. Two things I did notice: they have a weird smell and sometimes they tend to slide off my daughters head easier then others I have like this. They are made well though. I would recommend and buy again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-20","r":2.0,"t":"After soaking the headbands in water and dish soap for ...","x":"After soaking the headbands in water and dish soap for a few days, the strong fishy smell finally went away. I also ended up fixing about half of them became they came broken and were falling apart. You get what you pay for.. the price of these was very cheap so I understand how they're so cheaply made.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-21","r":5.0,"t":"These bows are super cute and a great deal","x":"These bows are super cute and a great deal!  I have been paying at least $5 a bow until I found this pack!  Now she has a matching one for each outfit.  I usually wear them wrapped around my arm for a little while to stretch them out before I put them on her.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-22","r":1.0,"t":"poorly made","x":"too bad I missed the return window. these headbands are poorly made. the nylon on the headbands are of poor quality and messily cut.  the center piece of the bow doesn't wrap around the nylon headband, which just makes it look really cheap. bad buy.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-23","r":1.0,"t":"Disgusting","x":"The headbands are very, very cute BUT they smell absolutely disgusting. They smell like dead fish. Every single one of them. I had 3 people smell them to make sure I wasn\u2019t crazy. Each person said the same thing. They are being returned.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B0761GY67F-24","r":5.0,"t":"Love the color variety and look.","x":"Absolutely loved these headbands. They fit my 1 month old daughter great! They seem like they will stretch to fit her until she\u2019s Atleast 6-9 months. Love all the colors as I now have 1 to match all her outfits. Would totally recommend","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the bows as cute and a great value, often noting the wide color selection.","cites":[3,5,7,9,13,14,15]},{"text":"The stretchy nylon bands are commonly described as soft, comfortable, and gentle, not leaving marks or imprints on babies' heads.","cites":[3,4,5,6,7,9,11,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the bows come unglued or fall off, requiring regluing.","cites":[10,11]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention an unpleasant factory or fishy smell, though some say it goes away after washing.","cites":[7,12,13]},{"text":"A small number of reviewers note the bands can leave dents on the baby's head or that one arrived damaged/unusable.","cites":[2,8]}]},"qa":[]}